# BrotherSBE control plane ownership.
#
# READ THE LIMIT BEFORE TRUSTING THE FILE.
#
# This repository has exactly ONE human today: @khalilmaaouni. He owns every
# path below and he is also the author of nearly every change to them. A
# CODEOWNERS entry is a second-party control only when the owner is somebody
# other than the pull request author, so as written this file CANNOT stop the
# author from approving his own control plane change. The release blockers
# file (item 5.1) asks for an owner "that is not the pull request author".
# That requirement is NOT met today. This comment exists so that nobody reads
# the file and concludes otherwise, and so that no report anywhere cites it as
# evidence of independent review.
#
# What this file does do today:
#   1. It routes the review request, so a control plane change is visible as a
#      control plane change rather than as an ordinary diff.
#   2. It is the switch that becomes a real independent gate on the day a
#      second human joins: add that person to the lines below and the branch
#      ruleset's "require review from Code Owners" rule starts binding somebody
#      who is not the author.
#   3. `sbe protections verify` reads it locally, with no network, and FAILS
#      when any control plane path listed below has no owner line at all.
#
# What it must never be used for: claiming that BrotherSBE's control plane is
# independently reviewed. One operator cannot review himself, and a rule that
# routes a request to the person who wrote the change is not review. No review
# theater: when the second human joins, this comment gets rewritten with their
# name, and not before.
#
# Paths below are the control plane surface named in the release blockers file,
# item 5.1. Some of them (/.sbe/policy.yml, /.sbe/checks.yml,
# /src/brothersbe/policy.py) are delivered by other release blockers and do not
# exist yet; GitHub accepts an owner line for a path that does not exist, and
# listing them now means the day they land they are already owned.

/.github/workflows/                    @khalilmaaouni
/.github/actions/sbe-consumer/         @khalilmaaouni
/.github/CODEOWNERS                    @khalilmaaouni
/hooks/                                @khalilmaaouni
/.claude-plugin/                       @khalilmaaouni
/.sbe/policy.yml                       @khalilmaaouni
/.sbe/checks.yml                       @khalilmaaouni
/src/brothersbe/evidence.py            @khalilmaaouni
/src/brothersbe/policy.py              @khalilmaaouni
/tools/sbe_*hook*.py                   @khalilmaaouni
/tools/sbe_*guard*.py                  @khalilmaaouni
/tools/sbe_gate.py                     @khalilmaaouni
